@hostname=http://127.0.0.1
@port=8080

### Create new account

POST {{hostname}}:{{port}}/accounts
Content-Type: "application/json"

{
    "owner":"Petr",
    "currency": "USD"
}
### Create new account via curl
curl -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/accounts \
     -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
     -d '{"owner":"John Doe","currency":"EUR"}' 

### GetAccount by id
GET {{hostname}}:{{port}}/accounts/2
Accept: application/json

### Get Acconts 
GET {{hostname}}:{{port}}/accounts/?page_id=2&page_size=5
Accept: application/json